OL,3,GNEWSAHousing and apathy on the minds of
OL,4,AMiddle voters
OL,5,
OL,6,FAs the name suggests, the constituency
OL,7,Fof Middle sits at the heart of the Isle
OL,8,Fof Man.
OL,10,FFeaturing villages such as Union Mills
OL,11,F- known for its links with the Bee Gees
OL,12,F- Crosby and Port Soderick on the
OL,13,Fcoast, it is also dominated by the TT
OL,14,Fcourse.
OL,16,FThe island's Noble's Hospital is in the
OL,17,Fconstituency and a number of business
OL,18,Fparks are also situated there, despite
OL,19,Fits rural appearance.
